{"id":"395bd59d8e3d72f2","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-levinzvonkin.md","title":"Levin–Zvonkin Coding Theorem","display":"thm-levinzvonkin — Levin–Zvonkin Coding Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-levinzvonkin","aliases":["43-thm-levinzvonkin"],"display":"thm-levinzvonkin — Levin–Zvonkin Coding Theorem","depends_on":["[[43-df-apriori]]","[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","[[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorems 6.9.2 and 6.9.4","source_printed_pages":"106–107","source_pdf_pages":"126–127","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-levinzvonkin"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-levinzvonkin</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-levinzvonkin — Levin–Zvonkin Coding Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cfad5734457defe6\" href=\"?note=cfad5734457defe6\" title=\"43-df-apriori\">43-df-apriori</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5078ab697e20add\" href=\"?note=f5078ab697e20add\" title=\"43-df-universal-prefix-machine\">43-df-universal-prefix-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorems 6.9.2 and 6.9.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"106–107"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"126–127"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 是固定前缀复杂度，不要求由同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf m_U\">\\(\\mathbf m_U\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cfad5734457defe6\" href=\"?note=cfad5734457defe6\" title=\"43-df-apriori\">43-df-apriori</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left|K(\\sigma)+\\log_2\\mathbf m_U(\\sigma)\\right|\\le c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left|K(\\sigma)+\\log_2\\mathbf m_U(\\sigma)\\right|\\le c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>通用机器对每个串有输出，故对数参数严格为正。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=K_U\">\\(K=K_U\\)</span>，最短描述立即给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{-K(\\sigma)}\\le\\mathbf m_U(\\sigma)\">\\(2^{-K(\\sigma)}\\le\\mathbf m_U(\\sigma)\\)</span>；另一方向用 KC 编码，换固定通用机器仅改变常数。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorems 6.9.2 and 6.9.4；印刷页 106–107，PDF 页 126–127。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-apriori","status":"resolved","id":"cfad5734457defe6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-apriori]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-universal-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"f5078ab697e20add","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-apriori","status":"resolved","id":"cfad5734457defe6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U$ 满足 $\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)$；$K$ 是固定前缀复杂度，不要求由同一个 $U$ 定义；$\\mathbf m_U$ 见 [[43-df-apriori]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf m_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left|K(\\sigma)+\\log_2\\mathbf m_U(\\sigma)\\right|\\le c.","display":true},{"tex":"K=K_U","display":false},{"tex":"2^{-K(\\sigma)}\\le\\mathbf m_U(\\sigma)","display":false}],"bytes":1444,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-143","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-levinzvonkin]] — Levin–Zvonkin Coding Theorem"}],"outgoing":["cfad5734457defe6","6cd902d852c2c848","f5078ab697e20add"]}